 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Thirty minutes. We had him talking about world models going from pixels to actions.",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 6.1
  },
  {
   "text": "We had Dillon talking about building agents on owned versus rented land, and then we had Frank.",
   "start": 6.1,
   "end": 11.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Talking about how they think about leveraging applied AI as it relates to making decisions around investments.",
   "start": 11.8,
   "end": 18.25
  },
  {
   "text": "First of all, let's just give a round of applause to all the speakers.",
   "start": 18.25,
   "end": 23.55
  },
  {
   "text": "Definitely made the event possible, and then.",
   "start": 23.55,
   "end": 30.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Two final housekeeping items before we close out the day.",
   "start": 30.3,
   "end": 35.3
  },
  {
   "text": "First. Very important one.",
   "start": 30.3,
   "end": 37.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Go speak to humans.",
   "start": 35.3,
   "end": 37.9
  },
  {
   "text": "That is Housekeeping Item One.",
   "start": 37.9,
   "end": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "There's been incredible content covered today.",
   "start": 37.9,
   "end": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "Again, that is surface area for you to be able to connect with others.",
   "start": 43,
   "end": 46.45
  },
  {
   "text": "And live in Edge City by having intellectually stimulating conversations.",
   "start": 46.45,
   "end": 51.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't let the opportunity pass you by, and then second, this is.",
   "start": 51.2,
   "end": 55.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Just one day of an amazing event.",
   "start": 55.3,
   "end": 58
  },
  {
   "text": "So tomorrow things kick off again right before 9 a.m.",
   "start": 58,
   "end": 63.55
  },
  {
   "text": "So make sure you get here bright and early.",
   "start": 58,
   "end": 63.55
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you all for coming.",
   "start": 63.55,
   "end": 66.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Thanks for having me, and see you tomorrow.",
   "start": 63.55,
   "end": 66.4
  }
 ],
